                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} hom_A(N_1,N_2)
                  is, if it exists, the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equalizer"} equalizer
                .maruku-equation
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
