                    \\,.
          .proof
            %h6#proof_19 Proof
            %p
              By construction these functors with smash products are the composites, according to prop.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#MonoidalFunctorComp"}
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
