            %p
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homomorphism"} homomorphism
              of symmetric commutative ring spectra
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                    %mi E
                    %mo ⟶
                    %mi E
                    %mo ′
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f \colon E \longrightarrow E'
              is a sequence
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi f
                      %mi n
