                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Path_\ast(f)
              the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mapping+cocone"} mapping cocone
              of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#MappingConeAndMappingCocone"}> def.
              ) formed with respect to the standard
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cylinder+spectrum"} cylinder spectrum
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo ∧
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi I
                      %mo +
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \wedge (I_+)
              hence formed degreewise with respect to the standard
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reduced+cylinder"} reduced cylinder
              of pointed topological spaces.
          %p
