          %p One use of free spectra is that they serve to co-represent adjuncts of structure morphisms of spectra. To this end, first consider the following general existence statement.
          #CorepresentingOfAdjunctsOfStructureMapsExists.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_9 Lemma
            %p
