                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I_{Top^{\ast/}}
              from above. Similarly, write
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi J
                      %mi dia
                      %mi strict
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mo ≔
                    %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %mrow
                      %mo {
                      %msubsup
                        %mi F
                        %mi c
                        %mi dia
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
