                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} J_{Top^{\ast/}_{cg}}
          #CofibrantGenerationOfStrictModelStructure.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_26 Proposition
            %p
              The sets
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi I
                      %mi dia
                      %mi strict
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I^{strict}_{dia}
              and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi J
                      %mi dia
                      %mi strict
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} J^{strict}_{dia}
              from def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#GeneratingAndGeneratingAcyclicCofibrationsForDiagramSpectra"}
              are, respectively sets of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generating+cofibrations"} generating cofibrations
              and generating acyclic cofibrations that exhibit the strict model structure
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
