                    \\mathbb{S}_{Dia}Mod_{strict}
                    \\simeq
                    [\mathbb{S}_{Dia}Free_{Dia}Mod^{op}, Top^{\ast/}]_{proj}
            %p
              of the opposite of the category of free spectra on objects in
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝒞
                      %mo ↪
