            %p
              By the general discussion in
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P"} Part P – Classical homotopy theory
              (
              %a{:href => "classical+model+structure+on+topological+spaces#ProjectiveModelStructureOnTopEnrichedFunctors"} this
              theorem) the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+model+structure+on+functors"} projective model structure on functors
