          %h5#topological_enrichment Topological enrichment
          %p
            By the general properties of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+model+structure+on+functors"} projective model structure
            on
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topologically+enriched+functors"} topologically enriched functors
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StrictModelStructureOnDiagramSpectra"}
            implies that the strict model category of structured spectra inherits the structure of an
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+model+category"} enriched model category
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classical+model+structure+on+pointed+topological+spaces"} classical model structure on pointed topological spaces
            = succeed ")," do
              %em
                %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-1#TopologicalEnrichment"} part 1.1 – Topological enrichement
