                    \\,,
            %p
              where we used that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo ⊗
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \otimes (-)
              is a left adjoint and hence preserves colimits, and we used prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SmashProductOfFreeSpectra"}
              to evaluate the smash product of free spectra.
            %p
              Now by lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#S0FreeSpectraCellDegreewise"}
              the morphism
            .maruku-equation
