              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relative+cell+complex"} relative cell complex
              inclusion, hence is itself degreewise a relative cell complex inclusion, and therefore its pushout
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
