            %p Now consider the vertical morphism in the above square
            %p
              The same argument that we just used shows that this is the smash tensoring of the stable weak homotopy equivalence
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi k
