                      %mi S
                      %mn 0
                    %mo ∈
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msubsup
                      %mi Top
                      %mi cg
                      %mrow
                        %mo *
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mi Quillen
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^0 \in (Top^{\ast/}_{cg})_{Quillen}
              is cofibrant, this is a cofibrant orthogonal spectrum. Hence, as in the proof of lemma
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SmashProductOfSpectraCompatibleWithSuspension"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi Σ
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi n
                          %mn 1
                    %mi 𝕊
