            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+cofiber+sequences"} homotopy cofiber sequences
            of spectra (
            %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-1#StableHomotopyCategoryIsTriangulated"}> prop.
            ).
          %p
            While this is the situation already for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sequential+spectra"} sequential spectra
            (
            %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-1#StableHomotopyCategoryIsIndeedStabilizationOfClassicalHomotopyCategory"}> thm.
